# Signal Fire, by MiniMax M3.1 Flash and SZ. An original peak-time techno anthem for the Techno
# style: a chopped wordless vocal hook over a 909 kit, a rolling off-beat sub bass, and chord
# stabs, with a snare-roll build into two drops and a longer final drop.
#
# The chord loop is F# minor - D - A - E, one chord a bar, for all 136 bars. The hook is four bars,
# one bar a chord: three rising chops, a gap, then the tail. Everything else follows that map.
# chords: F#m D A E
#
# Form 1-16: intro - drums and bass
# Form 17-32: groove - the chord stabs join
# Form 33-48: breakdown1 - the hook and the pad, no kick
# Form 49-56: build1 - snare roll, quarters then eighths then sixteenths
# Form 57-72: drop1 - everything
# Form 73-80: breakdown2 - the hook and the pad, no kick
# Form 81-88: build2 - a faster roll
# Form 89-120: drop2 - everything, the hook an octave up from bar 105
# Form 121-136: outro - drums and bass
title: Signal Fire
composer: MiniMax M3.1 Flash & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: techno
key: F# minor
tempo: 132
time: 4/4
about: A festival anthem: chopped wordless vocals over a 909 kick, built for the moment the drop lands.

